      "en": "The Philistines gathered themselves together, and came and encamped in Shunem; and Saul gathered all Israel together, and they encamped in Gilboa.",
      "ko": "블레셋 사람이 모여 수넴에 이르러 진 치매 사울이 온 이스라엘을 모아 길보아에 진 쳤더니",
      "source_text_hash": "c9fce0a3c892bd7311b4a1a3c0f2322d1d768914c4e137371c43a79b2d19d285",
      "translation_text_hash": "2d6703af279ae0949e582c3b2221b25257b90ef204841d47de558b22ade92f58",
