      ],
      "en": "When the woman saw Samuel, she cried with a loud voice; and the woman spoke to Saul, saying, “Why have you deceived me? For you are Saul!”",
      "ko": "여인이 사무엘을 보고 큰 소리로 외치며 사울에게 말하여 가로되 당신이 어찌하여 나를 속이셨나이까 당신이 사울이시니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "5367d5642413016fcdefe0ffd64ea68280324c0c52a0e880a12c655d088cc37e",
      "translation_text_hash": "c7d541c4e8ff2e915911eef3ad48f8a6bfe166e589e5c37c7b30ec05008e225e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
