      "en": "But he refused, and said, “I will not eat.” But his servants, together with the woman, constrained him; and he listened to their voice. So he arose from the earth and sat on the bed.",
      "ko": "사울이 거절하여 가로되 내가 먹지 아니하겠노라 그 신하들과 여인이 강권하매 그 말을 듣고 땅에서 일어나 침상에 앉으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "d440a94075b680096e7e0dd720c903ba11768caad8b3182777c4b57958f267a8",
      "translation_text_hash": "72165254e5864d33cc8250caa852d812c6acf156c90c39165210c5c80472b8df",
